```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Refund Request]) --> CheckIdempotency{Idempotency<br/>Key Exists?}

    CheckIdempotency -->|Yes| ReturnExisting[Return Existing Refund]
    CheckIdempotency -->|No| ValidateTransaction

    ValidateTransaction[Validate Transaction] --> ValidTx{Valid<br/>Transaction?}
    ValidTx -->|No| ErrorInvalidTx[Error: Invalid Transaction]
    ValidTx -->|Yes| CheckAmount

    CheckAmount[Check Refund Amount] --> ValidAmount{Amount<br/>Valid?}
    ValidAmount -->|No| ErrorInvalidAmount[Error: Invalid Amount]
    ValidAmount -->|Yes| CheckTimeLimit

    CheckTimeLimit[Check Time Limit] --> WithinTime{Within<br/>90 Days?}
    WithinTime -->|No| ErrorTimeLimit[Error: Time Limit Exceeded]
    WithinTime -->|Yes| CheckRateLimit

    CheckRateLimit[Check Rate Limit] --> RateLimitOK{Rate Limit<br/>OK?}
    RateLimitOK -->|No| ErrorRateLimit[Error: Rate Limit Exceeded]
    RateLimitOK -->|Yes| DetectFraud

    DetectFraud[Fraud Detection] --> FraudCheck{Risk<br/>Score?}
    FraudCheck -->|Critical| ErrorFraud[Error: Blocked - Fraud]
    FraudCheck -->|Low/Medium/High| ConvertCurrency

    ConvertCurrency[Convert to USD] --> CheckAuthThreshold{Amount<br/>>= $100?}

    CheckAuthThreshold -->|No| AutoApprove[Auto-Approve<br/>status = AUTHORIZED]
    CheckAuthThreshold -->|Yes| ManualReview[Manual Review Required<br/>status = PENDING]

    AutoApprove --> CreateRefund[Create Refund Record]
    ManualReview --> CreateRefund

    CreateRefund --> EmitEvent[Emit REFUND_INITIATED Event]
    EmitEvent --> StoreIdempotency[Store Idempotency Record]

    StoreIdempotency --> CheckAutoProcess{Auto-<br/>Approved?}
    CheckAutoProcess -->|Yes| QueueProcessing[Queue for Auto-Processing]
    CheckAutoProcess -->|No| NotifyAdmin[Notify Admin for Approval]

    QueueProcessing --> Success([Return Refund<br/>201 Created])
    NotifyAdmin --> Success
    ReturnExisting --> Success

    ErrorInvalidTx --> ErrorResponse([Return Error])
    ErrorInvalidAmount --> ErrorResponse
    ErrorTimeLimit --> ErrorResponse
    ErrorRateLimit --> ErrorResponse
    ErrorFraud --> ErrorResponse

    style Start fill:#4CAF50
    style Success fill:#4CAF50
    style ErrorResponse fill:#F44336
    style AutoApprove fill:#8BC34A
    style ManualReview fill:#FF9800
    style DetectFraud fill:#FFC107
```
